if ($normalizedNearAssist -notmatch 'hasActionMetadata && hasExactMovementDefinition && action\.IsPvP && !action\.CanTargetSelf && action\.Range > 0 && action\.RequiresLineOfSight && action\.ClassJob\.RowId == expectedJobId' -or
